		{
			dependencies: ["42E807C7DFC19EBF"]
			description: [
				"临时的防御通常由&d有害的屏障和陷阱&r构成。"
				""
				"&3Cactus&r can be made into &dharmful partial walls&r. &3Magma Blocks&r can be made into damaging floors, and &3Netherrack&r stays on fire forever - the three &dcombine to great effect&r."
				""
				"&3水桶&r、&3蜘蛛网&r和&3灵魂沙&r都能&d减缓来袭敌人的速度&r，与其他伤害来源配合得天衣无缝。"
				""
				"Water can also be &3deployed at your feet&r in panic scenarios to &dstall crowds&r."
				""
				"&3粉末雪&r可以杀死非骷髅生物，并对岩浆怪和烈焰人造成&d巨额伤害&r。可以用桶收集，或者将炼药锅放在雪地里收集。"
				""
